Z||000018||lowCG||01-20-2000||07:36 PM||||Now,now,just because the '88 suspensions were "improved" over the earlier cars doesn't mean that the earlier cars were "bad",heck,with improved tires,springs and shocks,an older car will probably feel great compared to an '88 with crusty tires on 15" rims.I've also had a few cars that will slip around(usually in the wet) like you've described from the steering geometry being a little bit off at full lock.||||reg||1
